sequenceDiagram
    actor customer as Customer
    participant web as Storefront
    participant api as Shop API
    participant db as Shop Database
    participant payments as Payment Provider
    participant jobs as Job Queue
    customer->>web: Check out a basket of 2 books
    web->>+api: POST /orders
    api->>db: Reserve stock, save the order as Pending Payment
    api->>payments: Create a payment session
    payments-->>api: Session URL
    api-->>-web: 201 Created, with the payment page URL
    web-->>customer: Redirect to the hosted payment page
    customer->>payments: Pay by card
    alt card accepted
        payments-)api: Webhook payment.succeeded
        api->>db: Mark the order Paid
        api-)jobs: Queue the confirmation email and the courier booking
        payments-->>customer: Back to the Storefront: order confirmed
    else card declined
        payments-)api: Webhook payment.failed
        api->>db: Release the stock, mark the order Payment Failed
        payments-->>customer: Back to the Storefront: try another card
    end
    Note over api,payments: Card details never reach Pageturner
